1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,500
Day 19 of the zombie outbreak.

2
00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:06,660
You're locked inside a gas station, and your
last bottle of water is empty.

3
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:09,540
But you didn't skip the boring
part of survival.

4
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:14,060
FEMA lists a hidden water source in almost
every building: the water heater.

5
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:16,650
Forty gallons, sitting in the back room.

6
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:18,110
You open the drain valve.

7
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:19,030
Clean water.

8
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:20,050
Weeks more.

9
00:00:20,070 --> 00:00:22,010
You almost laugh.

10
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,602
And that's the mistake.

11
00:00:23,622 --> 00:00:27,403
To reach the valve, you dragged the shelves
away from the back door.

12
00:00:27,423 --> 00:00:29,100
You never put them back.

13
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:29,740
3 a.m.

14
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:31,516
The back door clicks open.

15
00:00:31,536 --> 00:00:33,940
The latch was broken all along.

16
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:35,580
There's one of them inside.

17
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:38,240
Between you and everything you own.

18
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:40,454
You run for the strongest room you have.

19
00:00:40,474 --> 00:00:41,431
The walk-in cooler.

20
00:00:41,451 --> 00:00:43,510
You pull the door shut and hold it.

21
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:48,060
Now you're sealed in the dark, your breath turning
to fog, listening to it scratch

22
00:00:48,080 --> 00:00:49,100
at the door.

23
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:51,630
On your belt is the cashier's handset.

24
00:00:51,650 --> 00:00:55,750
It's wired to the speakers outside, the ones
that say 'pump four is ready.'

25
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:58,860
You press the button, and you bang
it against the wall.

26
00:00:58,990 --> 00:00:59,710
It turns.

27
00:00:59,830 --> 00:01:02,670
It follows the sound, out the back
door, into the rain.

28
00:01:02,690 --> 00:01:06,410
You sprint, slam the door, and bury it
under every shelf you own.

29
00:01:06,540 --> 00:01:08,460
You survived your mistake.

30
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:12,240
But you just told the whole county
exactly where you are.

31
00:01:12,420 --> 00:01:13,800
That was day nineteen.

32
00:01:13,820 --> 00:01:15,880
All thirty days are on my channel.

